<BaseLayout title="Contact Percentage Increase Calculator" description="Contact information for feedback, corrections, and questions about Percentage Increase Calculator.">
  <header class="page-head wrap"><h1>Contact</h1><p>Use this page for calculation corrections, accessibility feedback, or questions about the site.</p></header>
  <section class="content-page"><div class="content-grid wrap"><article class="prose">
    <h2>Public contact details</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:nikitasen126@gmail.com">nikitasen126@gmail.com</a> for site feedback, accessibility problems, or editorial corrections.</p>
    <h2>Reporting a calculation issue</h2>
    <p>Please include the calculator mode, both input values, the result you received, and the result you expected. Do not include private financial, employment, or account information.</p>
    <h2>Editorial corrections</h2>
    <p>For a guide correction, identify the page and the sentence or example that needs review. The calculation will be checked against the formula described in the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
  </article><aside class="side-index"><strong>Site information</strong><a href="/author/nikita-mondal/">Author</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/about/">About</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
